WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open Zenodo OAI Harvest for public metadata collection building.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Limit the harvest to one record and start the job.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Wait for the worker to finish and show the generated shard.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Search the generated collection to verify the harvested record.
